  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let the curve C be the mirror image of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2&#160;</mn></mrow></msup></math><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> with respect to the line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If A and B are the points of intersection of C with the line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the distance between A and B is</p>",
    "image": null
  },
