  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image64-0a5e3225-2674-4cee-92f5-450226bb04d9.png\"/><br >Equation of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>AA</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> is<br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math> ...(i)<br >Also<br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br ><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br ><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br ><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></mrow></msup></math> lies on parabola<br >Now,<br ><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br >AB = distance = 4 units",
